### Added
- Connection status toast notifications: brief toasts appear when the WebSocket
  connection drops ("Connection lost") and restores ("Reconnected"). Toasts do
  not fire on the initial page load. Built on Radix Toast primitives (already
  bundled with `radix-ui`) -- no new dependencies.
```

---

### Summary of Files Changed

| File | Action | Purpose |
|------|--------|---------|
| `components/ui/toast.tsx` | **Create** | Styled Radix Toast primitives (Provider, Viewport, Root, Title, etc.) |
| `components/ui/toaster.tsx` | **Create** | Toaster component that renders the toast queue |
| `hooks/use-toast.ts` | **Create** | Imperative `useToast()` hook for managing toast state |
| `app/dashboard/page.tsx` | **Modify** | Add `useEffect` for connection transitions + render `<Toaster>` |
| `CHANGELOG.md` | **Modify** | Document the feature |

No new dependencies need to be installed. The `radix-ui` package already provides `Toast.*` primitives, and `tw-animate-css` already provides the CSS animation utilities (`animate-in`, `animate-out`, `slide-in-from-bottom-full`, etc.).

